1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,475
Earth has an invisible wall that
scientists said nothing could cross.

2
00:00:04,495 --> 00:00:08,156
Then in 2024, the Sun proved them wrong.

3
00:00:08,286 --> 00:00:11,885
Giant belts of charged particles surround
our planet.

4
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:16,976
Deadly killer electrons stopped at a razor
sharp edge, three Earth radii out.

5
00:00:16,996 --> 00:00:19,804
Scientists called it the impenetrable
barrier.

6
00:00:19,934 --> 00:00:24,322
In May 2024, a G5 superstorm hit Earth.

7
00:00:24,342 --> 00:00:26,864
It crushed our protective plasma cloud,

8
00:00:26,884 --> 00:00:30,627
and let strange waves that sound like
birdsong take over.

9
00:00:30,757 --> 00:00:34,348
Japan's Arase satellite watched electrons
inside the

10
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:38,217
barrier get accelerated to millions of
electron volts.

11
00:00:38,237 --> 00:00:40,620
Five thousand times more than before.

12
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,531
The wall was breached from within.

13
00:00:42,661 --> 00:00:45,119
The extra radiation lasted for months,

14
00:00:45,139 --> 00:00:48,798
and it changes how we protect satellites
and astronauts.

15
00:00:48,818 --> 00:00:51,181
Follow for more space science!
